.TH PSModelChainLength 3 2024-01-03 "PsyC 0.9.4" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSModelChainLength\fR \- Get the number of models in multi\-model model

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
int  
.br
\fBPSModelChainLength\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the number of models in multi-model \fImodel\fR.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The number of models or:

.RS 4
\[bu] 0 if \fImodel\fR is \fINULL\fR or if the model chain is broken
.br

\[bu] 1 if \fImodel\fR is not a multi-model chain.
.br
.RE

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSAddModel(3), PSGetModelAtIndex(3), PSModelChainContains(3), PSModelChainHead(3), PSModelChainTail(3)
